  "notes": "USAGE: {引算|ひきざん} (also written as ⟦{引|ひ}き{算|ざん}→引き算：05333_hikizan⟧) is the elementary math term for subtraction.\n\nBASIC ARITHMETIC OPERATIONS:\n- ⟦{足算|たしざん}→足し算：05332_tashizan⟧ (addition)\n- {引算|ひきざん} (subtraction)\n- ⟦{掛算|かけざん}→掛け算：05334_kakezan⟧ (multiplication)\n- ⟦{割算|わりざん}→割り算：05335_warizan⟧ (division)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {引算|ひきざん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to do subtraction)\n- X⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧Y⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引算|ひきざん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to subtract Y from X)\n\nNOTE: While {引算|ひきざん} is the noun form, the verb ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ is commonly used: 10⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧3⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ = 10 - 3.",
